REMARK   1 SYNTHETIC: THE SEQRES RECORD CARRIES TEXT PAST COLUMN 70, WHERE NO
REMARK   1 RESIDUE NAME CAN BE, SO THE FREE GLUTAMATE AFTER TER IS SORTED BY
REMARK   1 THE LISTS AND NOT FLAGGED AS A RESIDUE OUTSIDE THE CHAIN.
SEQRES   1 A    2  ALA CYS                                             GLU
ATOM      1  CA  ALA A   1       1.000   2.000   3.000  1.00 20.00           C
ATOM      2  CA  CYS A   2       1.000   2.000   3.000  1.00 20.00           C
TER       3      CYS A   2
HETATM    4  N   GLU A 900       1.000   2.000   3.000  1.00 20.00           N
HETATM    5  CA  GLU A 900       1.000   2.000   3.000  1.00 20.00           C
END
